      "when": "[Your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase).",
      "target": "An **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit of yours, not a **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit, that has not yet been **selected to move** in the phase, has not been [set up](vsdata:core-rule/set-up) in the phase, and is up to 9\" from any **ASURYANI PSYKER** model of yours.",
      "effect": "The unit:\n\n- goes into **strategic reserves**\n- gets [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)\n- has to make an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** in the phase, even in your first turn",
      "restrictions": "The unit cannot be **selected to move** for the rest of the phase."
    },
    "summary": "**When:** [Your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase).\n\n**Target:** An **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit of yours, not a **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit, that has not yet been **selected to move** in the phase, has not been [set up](vsdata:core-rule/set-up) in the phase, and is up to 9\" from any **ASURYANI PSYKER** model of yours.\n\n**Effect:** The unit:\n\n- goes into **strategic reserves**\n- gets [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)\n- has to make an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** in the phase, even in your first turn\n\n**Restrictions:** The unit cannot be **selected to move** for the rest of the phase.",
